<title>USA: BOXING-HOLYFIELD RETAINS TITLE AS TYSON DISQUALIFIED.</title>
<headline>BOXING-HOLYFIELD RETAINS TITLE AS TYSON DISQUALIFIED.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-06-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evander Holyfield retained his World Boxing Association heavyweight title on Saturday night when Mike Tyson was disqualified for biting Holyfield twice in the third round.</p>
</text>
